  "key": "SFCC-887",
  "summary": "Contentful – Product Card Group with Lookbook (Shop the Edit) – Content Type & Schema",
  "description": "As a Site Merchandiser, I want to configure Shop the Edit modules in Contentful, so that I can curate editorial lookbook content — including the hero image, section header, and associated product selections — across pages including Shop the Edit and PLP without requiring a code deployment.\n\nThis story covers the Contentful content type definition and schema setup only. Rendering is covered in SFCC-313. The content type must support the full range of layout configurations available in the PWA component (SFCC-874): grid ratio (3 or 4), product tile quantity (2, 3, or 5), and an optional lookbook image. Content authoring is a Zimmermann responsibility.",
