  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "1. Given the Contentful environment is provisioned, when this story is completed, then a Product Card Group with Lookbook content type exists with the following fields: section title (optional), section link URL and label (optional), grid (required, values 3 or 4), quantity (required, values 2, 3, or 5), lookbook image (optional), lookbook image label (optional), product references (required, count matching quantity), and card type (required, applies to all tiles in the group).\n2. Given a Site Merchandiser sets quantity to 2, 3, or 5, when they author the entry, then the products field accepts exactly that number of product references.\n3. Given a Site Merchandiser attempts to publish with a product count that does not match the quantity value, then Contentful prevents publishing and surfaces a validation error.\n4. Given a Site Merchandiser sets quantity to 5, when they author the entry, then the lookbook image field is not required.\n5. Given a valid entry is published, when the PWA Kit component (SFCC-313) fetches it, then it receives all authored fields and renders accordingly.\n6. Given content has not been authored or the Contentful fetch fails, when the component renders, then it does not display — the page loads normally and no error is shown to the shopper.\n7. Given a Site Merchandiser sets card type, when the entry is published, then the selected card type variant applies to all product tiles in the group."
