  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "Content model\n\n1. A Product Card Group content type exists in Contentful with the following fields:\n   - Section Label (Short text, optional) — e.g. More from this category, Recommended for you. See open item below re: whether this should be mandatory.\n   - Shop All URL (Short text, optional) — the URL the SHOP ALL link navigates to\n   - Display count (Number, required) — accepts values 2, 3, or 4 only\n   - Products (References, required) — accepts 2, 3, or 4 product references matching the Display count\n\nAuthoring validation\n\n2. Given a merchandiser sets Display count to 2, then the Products field accepts exactly 2 product references.\n3. Given a merchandiser sets Display count to 3, then the Products field accepts exactly 3 product references.\n4. Given a merchandiser sets Display count to 4, then the Products field accepts exactly 4 product references.\n5. Given a merchandiser attempts to publish without the minimum number of products for the selected Display count, then Contentful prevents publishing and shows a validation error.\n\nPublishing\n\n6. Given a valid entry is published, then the PWA Kit component receives the section label, shop all URL, display count, and product references and renders accordingly per SFCC-743."
