      "id": "19104",
      "key": "SFCC-688",
      "summary": "Regional Storefronts — Country & Language Selector",
      "description": "As a Shopper, \n\n\nI want to be directed to the correct Zimmermann storefront for my location and be able to manually switch country, currency and language, \n\n\nso that I see local pricing, shipping options and content relevant to where I am.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading): \nThis story covers the experience of the country/language selector. The underlying PWA component (global/country-currency-selector) is built separately in the PWA Kit Components epic and consumed here. This story covers how they are triggered and behave from a shopper's perspective across storefronts.",
      "status": {
        "name": "Tech design",
        "category": "To Do",
        "color": "blue-gray"
      },
      "assignee": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "labels": [
        "Custom",
        "REG-020",
        "REG-021",
        "REG-022",
        "REG-023",
        "REG-024",
        "REG-025",
        "REG-026",
        "REG-027",
        "Squad-A"
      ],
      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Given a shopper is on the AU storefront, when they browse the site, then the country selector is showing the country and currency but is not selectable and cross-storefront navigation is not available."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Given a shopper is on any non-AU storefront, when they open the country selector from the footer, then countries are displayed grouped by region with their associated currency and a search field."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. Given a shopper opens the country selector, then they are warned that changing location may remove items from their bag before the redirect fires."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Given a shopper selects a country that maps to the EU Domestic storefront, when they make that selection, then a language selector is presented showing English, Français, Italiano, and Español before the redirect fires."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5. Given a shopper selects a language on the EU Domestic path, when they confirm, then they are redirected to the correct EU locale URL (e.g. /fr-eu/, /it-eu/, /es-eu/, /en-eu/)."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6. Given a shopper selects a country that maps to any storefront other than EU Domestic, when they confirm, then they are redirected directly to that storefront without a language selection step."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "7. Given a shopper selects China from the country selector, when they confirm, then they are routed to the HK storefront."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "8. Given a shopper selects Australia from the country selector on any non-AU storefront, when they confirm, then they are routed to the HK storefront."
                }
              ],
              "attrs": {
                "localId": "e5822472e837"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}"}

