  "key": "SFCC-933",
  "summary": "Shop the Look",
  "description": "As a Developer, \n\nI want a reusable Shop the Look React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \n\nso that it can be composed into PDP, Zimmerse and editorial pages to display curated product selections.\n\n----\n\nThe component renders a Shop the Look section with a title, carousel navigation, and a set of product cards. It does not own data fetching — it receives all content via props from the parent.\n\n**Component types:**\n\n|Type|Description|\n|---|---|\n|PDP - Runway/Editorial|Single large editorial image on the left with stacked product cards on the right|\n|PDP - Styling|Two product cards displayed side by side|\n|Zimmerse - Hero Right|Large hero image on the right with stacked smaller images on the left|\n|Zimmerse - Hero Left|Large hero image on the left with stacked smaller images on the right|\n|Zimmerse - Condensed|Three equal-width image columns|\n|Zimmerse - Product List|Four product cards displayed in a horizontal row|\n\n**Props in scope:**\n\n|Prop|Values|Notes|\n|---|---|---|\n|size|Desktop, Tablet, Mobile|Controls overall component size|\n|type|PDP - Runway/Editorial, PDP - Styling, Zimmerse - Hero Right, Zimmerse - Hero Left, Zimmerse - Condensed, Zimmerse - Product List|Controls layout variant|\n|showTitleAndLink|true, false|Applies to PDP - Runway/Editorial, PDP - Styling, and Zimmerse - Product List only. Toggles the Shop the Look title and navigation arrows.|",
